# Frontend

`frontend/` is the only UI. Stack: `docs/architecture/inventory-frontend.md`. Page map: `docs/architecture/frontend-backend-mapping.md`.

```
Page → useX() in src/lib/data.ts → API client → adapter when the view model differs
```

- The client unwraps `{ code, message, data, meta }`. Types stay snake_case (`Api*`).
- Hooks call `/api` only. Render `inventory_age`, `is_aging`, and `stock_state` from the response.
- Labels use glossary terms.
- Treat a null list and `[]` the same way in the unwrap helper.
